  "reference_equation_markdown": "Let $u$ denote probe Rabi frequency in MHz and $\\delta$ the coupling detuning in MHz. Define\n\\[\nL(w)=\\frac{1}{1+[(\\delta-\\delta_0)/w]^2},\\quad W=w_0+w_1u,\\quad N=n_0+n_1u.\n\\]\nThe selected predictor is\n\\[\n\\widehat I=b_0+b_1u+\\frac{Au}{1+u/u_s}L(W)-\\frac{Du^2}{u_d^2+u^2}L(N)+a u\\frac{\\delta-\\delta_0}{W}L(W).\n\\]\nThe broad and narrow responses have opposite signs; the last term permits line asymmetry. This is a compact response model, not a unique identification of two microscopic species.",
